        "original_id": "215b42c1-d17c-50c1-a6f9-853fcecaae99",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Rhys-Davies, Timothy Dalton, Ian Fleming, Samuel L. Jackson, Peter Berg, Damon Wayans, Jeff Goldblum, Jon Lovitz, Cheech Marin, Salli Richardson, Jamie Foxx\n- Works: The Living Daylights, The Untouchables, Shōgun, Sliders, Robin of Sherwood, I, Claudius, The Great White Hype\n- Organizations: SPECTRE, MI6\n- Topics: James Bond franchise\n\nFacts:\n- John Rhys-Davies played Macro in I, Claudius, Pilot Vasco Rodrigues in the mini-series Shōgun, King Richard I in Robin of Sherwood, Professor Maximillian Arturo in Sliders, and Agent Michael Malone in the 1993 remake of The Untouchables.\n- In 1987, The Living Daylights was released as the fifteenth film in the James Bond series and the first James Bond film to star Timothy Dalton as MI6 agent James Bond.\n- John Rhys-Davies played General Leonid Pushkin in the James Bond film The Living Daylights.\n- The Great White Hype stars Samuel L. Jackson, Peter Berg, Damon Wayans, Jeff Goldblum, Jon Lovitz, Cheech Marin, John Rhys-Davies, Salli Richardson, and Jamie Foxx.\n- SPECTRE, short for SPecial Executive for Counterintelligence, Terrorism, Revenge and Extortion, is a fictional organization appearing in Ian Fleming's James Bond novels, the films based on those novels, and James Bond video games.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "85fe24d7-dfa2-5d9f-bfbf-1f394b1b2fe5",
        "text": "Page: John Rhys-Davies. Sentence: He also played Agent Michael Malone in the 1993 remake of the 1950s television series \"The Untouchables\", Pilot Vasco Rodrigues in the mini-series \"Shōgun\", Professor Maximillian Arturo in \"Sliders\", King Richard I in \"Robin of Sherwood\", General Leonid Pushkin in the James Bond film \"The Living Daylights\", and Macro in \"I, Claudius\".\nPage: The Living Daylights. Sentence: The Living Daylights (1987) is the fifteenth entry in the \"James Bond\" film series and the first to star Timothy Dalton as the fictional MI6 agent James Bond.\nPage: The Great White Hype. Sentence: It stars Samuel L. Jackson, Peter Berg, Damon Wayans, Jeff Goldblum, Jon Lovitz, Cheech Marin, John Rhys-Davies, Salli Richardson and Jamie Foxx.\nPage: SPECTRE. Sentence: SPECTRE (SPecial Executive for Counterintelligence, Terrorism, Revenge and Extortion) is a fictional organisation featured in the James Bond novels by Ian Fleming, the films based on those novels, and James Bond video games.",
